msgid ""
"We can see that Python loaded ``4855 KiB`` data (bytecode and constants) from modules and that "
"the :mod:`collections` module allocated ``244 KiB`` to build :class:`~collections.namedtuple` "
"types."
msgstr ""
"می‌توانیم ببینیم که پایتون ``4855 KiB`` داده (بایت‌کد و ثابت‌ها) را از ماژول‌ها بارگذاری کرده و "
"ماژول :mod:`collections` مقدار ``244 KiB`` را برای ساخت انواع :class:`~collections.namedtuple` "
"تخصیص داده است."

msgid "See :meth:`Snapshot.statistics` for more options."
msgstr "برای گزینه‌های بیشتر، :meth:`Snapshot.statistics` را ببینید."

msgid "Compute differences"
msgstr "محاسبه تفاوت‌ها"

msgid "Take two snapshots and display the differences::"
msgstr "دو تصویر لحظه‌ای (snapshot) بگیرید و تفاوت‌ها را نمایش دهید::"

msgid ""
"import tracemalloc\n"
"tracemalloc.start()\n"
"# ... start your application ...\n"
"\n"
"snapshot1 = tracemalloc.take_snapshot()\n"
"# ... call the function leaking memory ...\n"
"snapshot2 = tracemalloc.take_snapshot()\n"
"\n"
"top_stats = snapshot2.compare_to(snapshot1, 'lineno')\n"
"\n"
"print(\"[ Top 10 differences ]\")\n"
"for stat in top_stats[:10]:\n"
"    print(stat)"
msgstr ""
"import tracemalloc\n"
"tracemalloc.start()\n"
"# ... start your application ...\n"
"\n"
"snapshot1 = tracemalloc.take_snapshot()\n"
"# ... call the function leaking memory ...\n"
"snapshot2 = tracemalloc.take_snapshot()\n"
"\n"
"top_stats = snapshot2.compare_to(snapshot1, 'lineno')\n"
"\n"
"print(\"[ Top 10 differences ]\")\n"
"for stat in top_stats[:10]:\n"
"    print(stat)"

